      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\overline{x}&=\\frac{18+18+20+26+10+8+21+14+16+14+12+16+9}{13}\\\\\\overline{x}&=\\frac{202}{13}\\\\\\overline{x}&\\approx15.54\\end{align*}$$\nThe mean is $15.54$ kicks, correct to two decimal places.",
